  "body": "Unlock the Potential - Prime Freehold Land in Stanmore Bay!\r\n\r\nThis freehold section in beautiful Stanmore Bay offers you the opportunity to create your dream home in coastal paradise  - with sea view and the beach just 10  short stroll away.  Located off the beginning of Vipond Road, don't let the address deceive you. \r\n\r\nPositioned for both lifestyle and future value, you'll love the easy access to local shopping hubs, main arterial routes, and the upcoming Penlink expressway - set to transform travel across the Peninsula and connect you more seamlessly than ever to Auckland and beyond.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from the vibrant cafés, shops, and golden sands of Orewa, this is the ideal spot to enjoy a relaxed coastal lifestyle without compromising on convenience. Whether you're building your forever home or securing a blue-chip investment, opportunities like this are few and far between.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are motivated and open to all discussions - they're ready to talk, negotiate, and help make this opportunity yours.\r\n\r\nDon't let this slice of paradise slip away - call today to explore the potential!",
